# Retry and concurrent consistency

A booking owner has two seats and retried requests. Preserve idempotency, reject changed payloads under a reused key and avoid overselling or partial commits.

## Input and contract
input/fixture.json; input/dictionary.md; project version 1

## Finding and reproducible output
```json
{
  "remaining": 1,
  "responses": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "status": 201
    },
    {
      "id": "R2",
      "status": 201
    },
    {
      "id": "R3",
      "status": 409
    },
    {
      "id": "R4",
      "status": 503
    }
  ],
  "committed": 1
}
```

## Failure prevented
Replaying a key must not reserve seats twice.

## Decision and limits
Accept only the specified result set. Escalate a missing identity, permission, business probe or required not-run item. This is an original synthetic teaching reference, not evidence of learner execution or real employment.

